#: src/main.ui:60
msgid "Face models"
msgstr "Tauira kanohi"

#: src/main.ui:75
msgid ""
"Snapshots of your face that Ubuntu Hello compares against. Keep at least "
"two, recorded in different lighting."
msgstr ""
"Ko nga whakaahua o to kanohi ka whakatauritea e Ubuntu Hello. Kia mau ki te "
"rua, ka tuhia ki nga rama rereke."

#: src/main.ui:97
msgid "Showing saved models for:"
msgstr "Whakaatu ana i nga tauira kua tiakina mo:"

#: src/main.ui:137
msgid ""
"Only one face model is enrolled. Glasses, a change of facial hair or "
"different lighting change how your face looks to the camera, so a single "
"model can fail (for example in the evening under lamps). Add a second model "
"with glasses on or off, your other look, or in different light to keep "
"unlocking reliable."
msgstr ""
"Kotahi noa te tauira kanohi kua rēhitatia. Mā ngā mōhiti, te rerekētanga o "
"te huruhuru kanohi, te māramatanga rerekē rānei ka rerekē te āhua o tō "
"kanohi ki te kāmera, nō reira ka rahua pea te tauira kotahi (hei tauira i te "
"ahiahi i raro i ngā rama). Tāpirihia tētahi tauira tuarua me ngā mōhiti, "
"kāore rānei, tō āhua kē, i te māramatanga rerekē rānei kia pono tonu te "
"wewete."

#: src/main.ui:146
msgid "Add a second model"
msgstr "Tāpirihia he tauira tuarua"

