#: src/main.ui:430 src/main.ui:583
msgid "Notifications"
msgstr "Whakamōhiotanga"

#: src/main.ui:445
msgid ""
"A desktop notification shows while Ubuntu Hello looks for your face, then "
"reports the result. Failed attempts stay in the notification list."
msgstr ""
"Ka whakaatuhia he panui papamahi i a Ubuntu Hello e rapu ana i to kanohi, "
"katahi ka whakaatu i te hua. Ko nga nganatanga i rahua ka noho ki te rarangi "
"whakamohiotanga."

#: src/main.ui:476
msgid "Show notifications"
msgstr "Whakaatu whakamohiotanga"

#: src/main.ui:482
msgid ""
"One card per face-authentication attempt, updated in place with the result."
msgstr ""
"Kotahi te kaari mo ia nganatanga whakamotuhēhē kanohi, kua whakahoutia me te "
"hua."

#: src/main.ui:513
msgid "Notification sounds"
msgstr "Ka tangi whakamohiotanga"

#: src/main.ui:519
msgid "Play the system sound for a recognized or failed attempt."
msgstr ""
"Whakatangihia te oro o te punaha mo te nganatanga kua mohiohia, i rahua "
"ranei."

#: src/main.ui:550
msgid "Include diagnostics"
msgstr "Whakauruhia nga tātaritanga"

#: src/main.ui:556
msgid ""
"Add the model, certainty vs. threshold, frames, camera and timing to each "
"card. Useful when reporting a problem."
msgstr ""
"Tāpirihia te tauira, te papu me te paepae, nga papa, te kamera me te wa ki "
"ia kaari. Ka whai hua i te wa e ripoata ana i tetahi raru."

#: src/main.ui:618 src/main.ui:734
msgid "Security"
msgstr "Haumarutanga"

#: src/main.ui:633
msgid ""
"How closely your face has to match, and whether Ubuntu Hello asks you to "
"confirm that you are really there."
msgstr ""
"Me pēhea te tino ōrite o tō kanohi, me te pātai rānei a Ubuntu Hello kia "
"whakaū koe kei konei tonu koe."

#: src/main.ui:657
msgid "Face match strictness"
msgstr "Te māro o te ōritetanga kanohi"

#: src/main.ui:665 src/onboarding.ui:151
msgid "Fast"
msgstr "Tere"

#: src/main.ui:672 src/onboarding.ui:182
msgid "Balanced"
msgstr "Taurite"

#: src/main.ui:680 src/onboarding.ui:213
msgid "Secure"
msgstr "Haumaru"

#: src/main.ui:702 src/onboarding.ui:250
msgid "Ask me to nod to confirm"
msgstr "Me tono kia tungou ahau hei whakaū"

#: src/main.ui:708 src/onboarding.ui:259
msgid ""
"After your face matches, a notification asks you to nod. A photo held up to "
"the camera cannot nod."
msgstr ""
"Ka ōrite ana tō kanohi, ka tono mai tētahi pānui kia tungou koe. Kāore e "
"taea e tētahi whakaahua ka whakaarahia ki mua i te kāmera te tungou."

#: src/main.ui:771 src/onboarding.ui:759
msgid "Keyring / KWallet Auto-Unlock"
msgstr "Whakatangitangi / KWallet Wewete-Aunoa"

#: src/main.ui:786
msgid ""
"Enable face authentication to automatically unlock your login keyring or "
"KWallet on login. This securely stores your password sealed in the TPM when "
"available, or encrypted with AES-256-GCM using a root-only master key. Face "
"auth sets PAM_AUTHTOK for pam_gnome_keyring or pam_kwallet5 depending on "
"your desktop."
msgstr ""
"Whakahohea te motuhēhēnga kanohi kia wetewetehia aunoatia tō keyring "
"takiuru, tō KWallet rānei, i te takiuru. Ka penapena haumaru tēnei i tō "
"kupuhipa — kua hiritia ki roto i te TPM ina wātea, kua whakamunatia rānei ki "
"te AES-256-GCM mā te kī matua mā te root anake. Ka whakaritea e te "
"motuhēhēnga kanohi a PAM_AUTHTOK mō pam_gnome_keyring, mō pam_kwallet5 "
"rānei, i runga anō i tō papamahi."

