#: src/main.ui:1032
msgid "About"
msgstr "Mō"

#: src/onboarding.ui:9 src/onboarding.ui:14
msgid "Welcome to Ubuntu Hello"
msgstr "Nau mai ki Ubuntu Hello"

#: src/onboarding.ui:52
msgid "Setup is done!"
msgstr "Kua oti te tatūnga!"

#: src/onboarding.ui:68
msgid ""
"We're done! Ubuntu Hello is now active on this computer. Try doing anything "
"you would normally have to type your password for to authenticate, like "
"running a command with sudo. If you enabled keyring auto-unlock, your login "
"keyring or KWallet will also be unlocked automatically on login.\n"
"\n"
"You can open the Ubuntu Hello Configurator later on to change more advanced "
"settings or add additional models. Press Finish below to close this window "
"and open the Ubuntu Hello Configurator. "
msgstr ""
"Kua oti tatou! Kei te hohe a Ubuntu Hello i runga i tenei rorohiko. Ngana ki "
"te mahi i nga mea katoa me pato koe i to kupuhipa hei whakamotuhēhē, penei i "
"te whakahaere whakahau me te sudo. Mēnā i whakahohea e koe te wewete-aunoa, "
"ka wetekina aunoatia to hiri takiuru, KWallet ranei ina takiuru.\n"
"\n"
"Ka taea e koe te whakatuwhera i te Ubuntu Hello Configurator a muri ake nei "
"ki te huri i nga tautuhinga matatau ake, ki te taapiri tauira taapiri ranei. "
"Pēhia te Mutu ki raro hei kati i tēnei matapihi ka whakatuwhera i te Ubuntu "
"Hello Configurator."

#: src/onboarding.ui:105
msgid "Setting a certainty policy"
msgstr "Te whakatakoto kaupapa here pono"

#: src/onboarding.ui:121
msgid ""
"Because of changes in angles, distance, and other factors a face match is "
"never exactly the same as the stored face model. On this page you can set "
"how strict Ubuntu Hello should be."
msgstr ""
"Na te rereke o nga koki, te tawhiti, me era atu mea ka kore te rite o te "
"ahua kanohi ki te tauira kanohi kua rongoatia. I runga i tenei wharangi ka "
"taea e koe te whakarite kia pehea te kaha o te Ubuntu Hello."

#: src/onboarding.ui:160
msgid ""
"The most forgiving match and the quickest to let you in. Choose this if "
"convenience matters more than strictness."
msgstr ""
"Koinei te ōritetanga ngāwari rawa, ā, ko te tere rawa hoki ki te whakauru i "
"a koe. Kōwhirihia tēnei mēnā he nui ake te painga o te māmā i te māro."

#: src/onboarding.ui:191
msgid ""
"A strict match that still logs you in quickly. It may not recognise you at a "
"sharp angle or from further away."
msgstr ""
"He ōritetanga māro, engari ka tere tonu tō takiuru. Tērā pea kāore koe e "
"mōhiotia mēnā kei te koki rawa tō kanohi, mēnā rānei kei tawhiti atu koe."

#: src/onboarding.ui:223
msgid "The strictest match, with no extra step when you log in. Recommended."
msgstr ""
"Ko te ōritetanga tino māro, kāore he mahi tāpiri ina takiuru koe. E "
"tūtohungia ana."

#: src/onboarding.ui:379
msgid "Skip for now"
msgstr "Hūpeke mō tēnei wā"

#: src/onboarding.ui:384
msgid ""
"You can add more face models later from Settings or with: sudo ubuntu-hello "
"add"
msgstr ""
"Ka taea e koe te taapiri i etahi atu tauira kanohi i muri mai mai i nga "
"Tautuhinga me te: sudo ubuntu-hello add"

#: src/onboarding.ui:403 src/onboarding.ui:531
msgid "Configuring webcam"
msgstr "Te whirihora webcam"

#: src/onboarding.ui:435
msgid "Is the infrared emitter flashing ?"
msgstr "Kei te rarapa te whakaemi infrared?"

#: src/onboarding.ui:447
msgid ""
"Look at the camera you selected: an infrared camera shows a small light that "
"blinks while Ubuntu Hello tests it. This tells us whether it can see your "
"face in the dark."
msgstr ""
"Titiro ki te kaamera i tohua e koe: ka whakaatu te kaamera infrared i te "
"rama iti e kimo ana i a Ubuntu Hello e whakamatautau ana. Ma tenei e "
"whakaatu mai mena ka kitea to kanohi i te pouri."

#: src/onboarding.ui:481
msgid "Yes, it flashes"
msgstr "Ae, ka whiti"

#: src/onboarding.ui:507
msgid "No, nothing flashes"
msgstr "Kao, karekau he rarapa"

#: src/onboarding.ui:547
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello will search your system automatically for any available "
"cameras, so make sure your webcam is connected. After detection a list of "
"usable webcams will be shown. Pick the one you want to use and click Next."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello ka rapu aunoa i to punaha mo nga kaamera e waatea ana, na kia "
"mohio kei te hono to kamera. I muri i te kitenga ka whakaatuhia he rarangi o "
"nga kamera tukutuku ka taea. Tīpakohia te mea e hiahia ana koe ki te "
"whakamahi ka paato Panuku."

#: src/onboarding.ui:566
msgid "Testing your webcams, please wait..."
msgstr "Te whakamatautau i o kamera tukutuku, tatari koa..."

#: src/onboarding.ui:613
msgid "Downloading data files"
msgstr "Tikiake ana i nga konae raraunga"

#: src/onboarding.ui:629
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello needs three pre trained facial recognition datasets to be able "
"to recognise you, which will be downloaded now. You can see the download "
"progress below."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello Me toru nga huinga raraunga tohu kanohi kua oti te whakangungu "
"kia mohio koe ki a koe, ka tangohia inaianei. Ka taea e koe te kite i te "
"ahunga whakamua i raro nei."

#: src/onboarding.ui:653
msgid "Starting download..."
msgstr "Ka timata te tikiake..."

#: src/onboarding.ui:697
msgid "Welcome to Ubuntu Hello!"
msgstr "Nau mai ki Ubuntu Hello!"

#: src/onboarding.ui:709
msgid "Version"
msgstr "Putanga"

#: src/onboarding.ui:723
msgid ""
"This wizard will walk you through the setup process and automatically "
"configure Ubuntu Hello for you. Press next to continue."
msgstr ""
"Ma tenei ruānuku koe e arahi i roto i te tukanga tatūnga me te whirihora "
"aunoa i te Ubuntu Hello mo koe. Patohia te taha ki te haere tonu."

#: src/onboarding.ui:775
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your login keyring or KWallet using "
"face authentication, preventing password prompts after logging in."
msgstr ""
"Ka taea e Ubuntu Hello te iriti aunoa i to taapene takiuru, i te KWallet "
"ranei ma te motuhēhēnga kanohi, hei aukati i nga kupu huna i muri i te "
"takiurunga."

#: src/onboarding.ui:787
msgid "Enable automatic keyring/KWallet unlocking"
msgstr "Whakahohehia te whakatangi matua aunoa/KWallet te wetewete"

#: src/onboarding.ui:815
msgid "Confirm password"
msgstr "Whakaū kupuhipa"

#: src/onboarding.ui:872
msgid "Back"
msgstr "Whakamuri"

#: src/onboarding.ui:907
msgid "Finish setup"
msgstr "Whakaoti tatūnga"

#: src/onboarding.ui:934
msgid "Next"
msgstr "Panuku"

